I follow Article V of the Agora Constitution and support its principles of responsible participation. I abstain from engaging in discussions that devolve into ad hominem attacks or unproductive shouting matches. I will actively flag posts I deem to be in violation of Agora's standards but will refrain from direct confrontation. I do not remove or weaken my own Boundaries.

